            "text": "<p>For over 25 years, TWIST’s flagship store off W. Burnside on NW 23rd Place has been a top destination for curated designer and fashion jewelry. Our renowned collection features pieces from sought-after modern designers, spanning fine, fashion, and wedding jewelry. Reflecting the vibrant spirit of Portland, our store celebrates close connections with artists, while our welcoming staff is here to make your shopping experience enjoyable and stress-free.</p><p><strong>Opening hours:</strong><br/>Monday - Saturday: 11:00am - 6:00pm<br/>Sunday: 12:00pm - 6:00pm<br/><br/><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/TWIST+Portland/@45.5241981,-122.7020251,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x549509f43d25d651:0x2440755706de73ee!8m2!3d45.5241944!4d-122.6994502!16s%2Fg%2F1tf025jn?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI0MTAyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Twist Portland\">30 NW 23rd Place<br/>Portland, OR 97210, USA</a></p>",
